    "text": "If <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> are non-parallel unit vectors and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is a vector which is perpendicular to <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> such that <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></