    "text": "<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is parallel to <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>&#215;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math><br />Let <math><mi>&#952;</mi></math> be angle between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mtext>&#8201;</mtext></math><br /><math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></m